---
// AegisTrans 產品頁 — 規格 v1.2 §3.4。語源：AegisTrans/README.md（程式碼實況 2026-07-16）。
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base
  title="AegisTrans 安心傳 — 你的裝置，一起工作"
  description="一個帳號連起你所有裝置。任何檔案、任何格式，不必同一個 Wi-Fi 也能互傳；還能把另一台電腦變成第二螢幕。支援 iOS、Android、macOS、Windows、Linux，內容端對端加密、裝置間直傳。"
  active="aegistrans"
>
  <!-- Hero -->
  <section class="hero" style="min-height:80vh">
    <div class="hero-content">
      <div class="hero-badge"><img src="/img/aegistrans-logo.png" alt="" style="height:1.3em;vertical-align:-.3em;margin-right:.2em" />AegisTrans 安心傳 · Beta</div>
      <h1>你的裝置，<span class="gradient">一起工作</span></h1>
      <p>
        一個帳號，連起你的 iPhone、Android、Mac、Windows 和 Linux。
        任何檔案都能傳，不必在同一個 Wi-Fi；還能把另一台電腦變成第二螢幕。
        內容端對端加密、裝置之間直接傳，不經過我們的伺服器。
      </p>
      <div class="hero-actions">
        <a href="#download" class="btn-primary">直接下載桌面版 ↓</a>
        <a href="https://trans.aegisrd.com" class="btn-ghost">免安裝試用 Web 版 ↗</a>
        <a href="#promises" class="btn-ghost">能做什麼 ↓</a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 核心產品訴求 -->
  <section class="problem" id="promises">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// FIVE PROMISES</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">跨裝置工作，不必先把內容交給雲端</h2>
      <p class="section-desc reveal">從傳一張照片，到把另一台電腦變成第二螢幕，AegisTrans 圍繞五件事打造。</p>
      <div class="problem-stat promise-grid">
        <div class="stat-card reveal">
          <div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><path d="M14.5 2H6a2 2 0 0 0-2 2v16a2 2 0 0 0 2 2h12a2 2 0 0 0 2-2V7.5L14.5 2z"></path><polyline points="14 2 14 8 20 8"></polyline><line x1="16" y1="13" x2="8" y2="13"></line><line x1="16" y1="17" x2="8" y2="17"></line></svg>各種檔案</div>
          <div class="desc">照片、影片、文件、壓縮檔或程式碼都能傳；AegisTrans 不改格式、不壓縮內容。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal">
          <div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg>五個平台</div>
          <div class="desc">iOS、Android、macOS、Windows、Linux，同一個帳號登入即可找到自己的裝置。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal">
          <div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect x="3" y="11" width="18" height="11" rx="2"></rect><path d="M7 11V7a5 5 0 0 1 10 0v4"></path></svg>內容不過站</div>
          <div class="desc">訊息與檔案先加密，再透過 WebRTC 在裝置間直傳；AegisRD 伺服器不接收內容。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal">
          <div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><path d="M15.2 3a2 2 0 0 1 1.4.6l3.8 3.8a2 2 0 0 1 .6 1.4V19a2 2 0 0 1-2 2H5a2 2 0 0 1-2-2V5a2 2 0 0 1 2-2z"></path><path d="M17 21v-7a1 1 0 0 0-1-1H8a1 1 0 0 0-1 1v7"></path><path d="M7 3v4a1 1 0 0 0 1 1h7"></path></svg>留在裝置</div>
          <div class="desc">傳過去的檔案就存在你的裝置上，不設到期日、不會因為沒續費而消失。單檔已驗證至 2GB。</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal">
          <div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>畫面接力</div>
          <div class="desc">在裝置間投放螢幕；桌面版可把另一台電腦作為延伸畫面。各平台能力依 Beta 進度開放。</div>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="scope-note reveal">
        單檔 2GB 為目前實測驗證過的上限，全平台適用。Web 版另受瀏覽器本身的記憶體與儲存限制。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Free / Pro 方案 -->
  <section class="cost" id="plans">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// FREE OR PRO</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">先免費使用，需要更多再升級</h2>
      <p class="section-desc reveal">傳檔完全免費 —— 不限裝置數、不限檔案類型、不收儲存費。付費解鎖的只有螢幕投放與桌面延伸。</p>
      <div class="moat-compare plan-grid">
        <div class="moat-col reveal">
          <div class="plan-name">Free</div>
          <div class="plan-price">NT$0</div>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 裝置數不限（技術上限 16 台）</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 各種檔案類型、原始內容不壓縮</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 單檔已驗證 2GB，不收儲存費</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 端對端加密、裝置間直傳</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 免費接收螢幕投放</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 五個平台原生 App + Web 版免安裝入口</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="moat-col highlight reveal">
          <div class="plan-name">Pro</div>
          <div class="plan-price">NT$30 <small>/ 月</small></div>
          <div class="plan-alt">NT$300 / 年 · NT$900 終身</div>
          <ul>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 包含 Free 的全部功能</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 主動把畫面投放到其他裝置</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 把另一台電腦變成延伸螢幕</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 圖片剪貼簿跨裝置同步</li>
            <li><span class="check">✓</span> 同一帳號跨平台套用 Pro 權益</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="scope-note reveal">
        16 台是金鑰管理的技術上限，不是付費門檻 —— 裝置越多，配對與金鑰更新的成本呈平方成長。螢幕投放與延伸各平台依 Beta 進度開放。正式價格以 App Store／Google Play 顯示為準。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 內容不過站 -->
  <section class="ai-engine">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// SECURITY</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">你的內容，只在你的裝置之間</h2>
      <p class="section-desc reveal">不是「我們承諾不看」，而是內容根本不會經過我們這裡。</p>
      <div class="ai-layers">
        <div class="ai-layer reveal">
          <div class="layer-badge l1">1</div>
          <div class="layer-info">
            <h4>裝置直接傳給裝置</h4>
            <p>檔案從你的手機直接送到你的電腦，中間不落地、不進雲端硬碟、不排隊等上傳。傳完就結束，我們沒有一份副本。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-layer reveal">
          <div class="layer-badge l2">2</div>
          <div class="layer-info">
            <h4>離開裝置前就已加密</h4>
            <p>內容在你的裝置上完成加密，只有你自己的其他裝置解得開。就算有人在網路上攔截，看到的也只是亂碼。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
        <div class="ai-layer reveal">
          <div class="layer-badge l3">3</div>
          <div class="layer-info">
            <h4>我們只負責幫兩台裝置認識彼此</h4>
            <p>伺服器處理的只有帳號、哪些裝置在線，以及牽線的過程。訊息與檔案內容不經過伺服器，所以我們無從讀取。</p>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 差異 -->
  <section class="moat">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// WHY AEGISTRANS</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">和一般傳檔工具的差別</h2>
      <div class="moat-compare">
        <div class="moat-col reveal">
          <h4>一般傳檔工具</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>兩台裝置要在同一個 Wi-Fi</li>
            <li>每次都要重新配對、掃碼或輸入代碼</li>
            <li>關掉分頁就中斷，功能只有傳檔</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
        <div class="moat-col highlight reveal">
          <h4><img src="/img/aegistrans-logo.png" alt="" style="height:1.3em;vertical-align:-.3em;margin-right:.2em" />AegisTrans 安心傳</h4>
          <ul>
            <li>一個帳號，自動認得你所有裝置</li>
            <li>不必同網路，在外面也傳得回家裡</li>
            <li>登入一次就記住，不用每次重新配對</li>
            <li>不只傳檔 —— 還能把另一台電腦變成第二螢幕</li>
          </ul>
        </div>
      </div>
      <p class="section-desc reveal" style="margin-top:2rem">
        傳檔只是起點。真正省時間的是：你的每一台裝置，從此像同一台在用。
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 實機展示（一列三張：登入 → 配對 → 訊息流；截圖已打碼） -->
  <section class="screenshots">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// SCREENSHOTS</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">產品實機展示</h2>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1.25rem;margin-top:3rem" class="trans-shots">
        <div class="ss-item" style="width:auto"><img src="/images/trans-login.png" alt="登入" loading="lazy" /><div class="ss-label">① Email + 密碼登入 — 工作階段密碼鎖</div></div>
        <div class="ss-item" style="width:auto"><img src="/images/trans-welcome.png" alt="同帳號多裝置配對" loading="lazy" /><div class="ss-label">② 同帳號登入即自動配對 — Mac / Windows / iPhone</div></div>
        <div class="ss-item" style="width:auto"><img src="/images/trans-message-stream.png" alt="訊息檔案流" loading="lazy" /><div class="ss-label">③ 手機拍的，秒進電腦 — 跨裝置訊息檔案流</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 螢幕投放與延伸（獨立卡片介紹 + 實機圖） -->
  <section class="moat">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// SCREEN CAST · <span style="color:var(--warn)">進階功能（正式版採訂閱制）</span></div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">螢幕投放與延伸</h2>
      <p class="section-desc reveal">
        <b>投放（鏡像）— 跨裝置</b>：手機或電腦的畫面即時投到另一台裝置（iOS 投放已實機驗證）。<br />
        <b>延伸螢幕 — 桌面版獨家</b>：把另一台電腦變成你的第二螢幕（虛擬顯示器驅動）。<br />
        兩者都走端對端加密 P2P 通道，畫面內容不經伺服器；收端一鍵接受、隨時關閉。
      </p>
      <div style="display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:1.25rem;margin-top:2.5rem" class="trans-shots">
        <div class="ss-item" style="width:auto"><img src="/images/trans-screenshare-request.png" alt="收到螢幕分享請求" loading="lazy" /><div class="ss-label">收到分享請求 — 拒絕 / 一鍵接受</div></div>
        <div class="ss-item" style="width:auto"><img src="/images/trans-screencast-fullscreen.png" alt="Mac 即時接收 Windows 畫面" loading="lazy" /><div class="ss-label">Mac 即時接收 Windows PC 畫面（可全螢幕）</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 平台與狀態（照程式碼實況，規格 §3.4「照實標示」） -->
  <section class="cost">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="section-label">// AVAILABILITY</div>
      <h2 class="section-title reveal">平台進度</h2>
      <div class="problem-stat">
        <div class="stat-card reveal"><div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg>Web</div><div class="desc">免安裝試用入口 — 立即開啟，適合先體驗核心傳輸</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal"><div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect width="20" height="14" x="2" y="3" rx="2"></rect><line x1="8" y1="21" x2="16" y2="21"></line><line x1="12" y1="17" x2="12" y2="21"></line></svg>Mac</div><div class="desc">Beta 可下載 — 含螢幕投放/延伸（已簽章公證）</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal"><div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect></svg>Windows</div><div class="desc">Beta 可下載</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal"><div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect x="5" y="2" width="14" height="20" rx="2"></rect><path d="M12 18h.01"></path></svg>iOS</div><div class="desc">實機測試中</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal"><div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"></line></svg>Linux</div><div class="desc">Beta 可下載（AppImage）</div></div>
        <div class="stat-card reveal"><div class="number" style="font-size:2rem"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg>Android</div><div class="desc">App 已完成建置，實機測試中</div></div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- 下載（桌面版 Beta 直接下載） -->
  <section class="cta-section" id="download">
    <h2>先試用，再帶到每一台裝置</h2>
    <p>
      Web 版免安裝；Mac 版已簽章公證，Windows / Linux 為 Beta 安裝檔（未簽章，安裝時系統可能提示）。iOS / Android 將於應用商店上架。<br />
      進階功能（螢幕投放／延伸）正式版採<b>訂閱制</b>；於手機 App 內訂閱後，權益隨同一帳號套用到其他裝置。
    </p>
    <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center;margin-bottom:1rem">
      <a href="https://trans.aegisrd.com" class="btn-primary"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="10"></circle><path d="M12 2a14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0 20 14.5 14.5 0 0 0 0-20"></path><path d="M2 12h20"></path></svg>免安裝試用 Web 版</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center">
      <a href="/downloads/AegisTrans-mac.zip" class="btn-primary"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><path d="M12 20.94c1.5 0 2.75 1.06 4 1.06 3 0 6-8 6-12.22A4.91 4.91 0 0 0 17 5c-2.22 0-4 1.44-5 2-1-.56-2.78-2-5-2a4.9 4.9 0 0 0-5 4.78C2 14 5 22 8 22c1.25 0 2.5-1.06 4-1.06z"></path><path d="M10 2c1 .5 2 2 2 5"></path></svg>下載 Mac 版（.zip）</a>
      <a href="/downloads/AegisTrans-win-setup.exe" class="btn-primary" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--blue),#60a5fa)"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><rect x="3" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="3" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="3" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect><rect x="14" y="14" width="7" height="7" rx="1"></rect></svg>下載 Windows 版（.exe）</a>
      <a href="/downloads/AegisTrans-linux.AppImage" class="btn-primary" style="background:linear-gradient(135deg,#7c3aed,#a78bfa)"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><polyline points="4 17 10 11 4 5"></polyline><line x1="12" y1="19" x2="20" y2="19"></line></svg>下載 Linux 版（AppImage）</a>
    </div>
    <div class="hero-actions" style="justify-content:center;margin-top:1rem">
      <span class="btn-ghost" style="cursor:default"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><path d="M12 20.94c1.5 0 2.75 1.06 4 1.06 3 0 6-8 6-12.22A4.91 4.91 0 0 0 17 5c-2.22 0-4 1.44-5 2-1-.56-2.78-2-5-2a4.9 4.9 0 0 0-5 4.78C2 14 5 22 8 22c1.25 0 2.5-1.06 4-1.06z"></path><path d="M10 2c1 .5 2 2 2 5"></path></svg>App Store · 即將上架</span>
      <span class="btn-ghost" style="cursor:default"><svg width="1em" height="1em" viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" style="vertical-align:-.15em;margin-right:.25em"><path d="M12 8V4H8"></path><rect width="16" height="12" x="4" y="8" rx="2"></rect><path d="M2 14h2"></path><path d="M20 14h2"></path><path d="M15 13v2"></path><path d="M9 13v2"></path></svg>Google Play · 即將上架</span>
    </div>
    <p style="margin-top:1.5rem;color:var(--text2);font-size:.9rem">
